<h3><u>Abbas sa beta dede</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>aise farzand ke khatir hai tamanna-e-ali<br />
Jo bahadur ho, mujahid ho, wafadaar bhi ho<br />
Ya rab mere ya rab ya rab mere ya rab</p>

<p>Ya ilahi mujhe abbas sa beta dede<br />
Jab mere ghar me alam hai to alamdaar bhi ho</p>

<p>1. Ek jari chahiye tarikh-e-shuja-at ke liye<br />
